  <item>
    <title>Vol.5｜你们去上香的时候会报自己的身份证吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6606c6241519139e4f696898</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6606c6241519139e4f696898</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Apr 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是在某天讨论做啥播客选题的过程中产生了内容，也是放工后的第一次聊天内容，除了姜姜和大锤之外，还有美女嘉宾吱吱，一起来讨论我们对玄学的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 三位主播聊自己对玄学的看法和理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> 求签和占卜到底是统计学概率论还是心理暗示？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 吱吱给姜姜看紫薇斗数都跟现实完美命中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1837">30:37</a> 生辰八字是我们来到这个世界的初始设定吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 一些在我们身上发生过的神奇事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3104">51:44</a> 主播曾经为了实现目标居然献祭过自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3386">56:26</a> 选择到底是自己主导还是命运使然？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3681">1:01:21</a> 玄学在互联网时代都通过哪些商业模式在变现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3990">1:06:30</a> AI占卜靠谱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4215">1:10:15</a> 现在年轻人上香就像投简历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4538">1:15:38</a> 结束曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>———</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 听友吐槽邮箱：fanggonghou@shejiayu.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>🖼️ 封面插画：🧑‍🎨CANDY陳（公众号：CANDY陳的纸）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎶 片尾曲：《热带雨林》- 陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️ 主播：姜姜，吱吱，大锤</span></p>]]></description>
